Well the only things you need to win the game are the 7 candles, the bell,
the book, and the candleholder. Sorry I can't remember how the last one is
spelled. None of those is in the mines so you could skip it. Oh you need the
amulet as well but that's a given. On the other hand there can be some very
nice stuff in the mines, including real gems, the luckstone, nice armor, and
random stuff as well. Once you get past a certain point the mines are on the
easy side and you may find something you really need, say a ring of
levitation or speed boots or something like that. I usualy buy my protection
around character level 10 and the gems really help there provided I can sell
them.

As to the unicorn horn yes it will restore your strength, and any other
ability score loss you may have. (a)pply it till you get the "You feel great
message". Also be very careful against unicorns, as they tend to be very
powerful for there level.



